 `:schedule-construction-operation` / `:flag-safety-concern` /
 `:order-supplies`) carries `:effect :propose` ONLY -- the governor
 HARD-holds any proposal that doesn't (`effect-not-propose-violations`), a
 structural invariant distinguishing this actor from siblings that DO
 commit real-world actuation effects. Per-jurisdiction {JPN/USA/DEU}
 utility-strike-prevention/road-opening-notification legal-basis catalog
 (`utilconstr.facts`) with real official sources, and mail+phone
 (Resend+Twilio) safety-concern notification (`utilconstr.notify`) to the
 site's licensed-utility-engineer/site-supervisor/utility-authority
 contact roster. `:flag-safety-concern` and `:schedule-construction-
 operation` ALWAYS escalate to a human, at every phase, unconditionally.
 See `docs/` -- README `Actuation` section -- for the full governor-check
 enumeration and the rationale for each hard/soft rule."}
